          "Edit shared circuit inputs in the Load list beneath Cable sizing data; both grids use the same rows and recalculate together",
          "Choose visible columns independently for each grid; visibility is temporary and does not change Excel export",
          "Set list-wide suggestion defaults",
          "Review or accept blue italic suggestions",
          "Scan the dashboard and filter by Flagged/Fail/Incomplete/Suggested/Pass or search tags",
          "Open the issues list and jump to the cell",
