          "Images and scans: OCR in three orientations, then busbars and feeders are traced so each label joins the right circuit (vector PDFs are traced too)",
          "Schedules, single-line-diagram circuits and CAD blocks become candidate rows with From/To feeder links",
          "Review: untick rows, check italic worked-out values and notes; fed-from-only feeders start unticked",
          "Create the load list or add to the current one",
          "The Cable Sizing sheet calculates and suggests blanks; fill flagged inputs (e.g. PF, runs) and export"
        ],
