          "Export panel sheets with the template's six-row heading, four added equipment columns, operating-factor summary, live formulas and landscape print layout, or Send to cable sizing (From = panel, To = description, G = rated input power). The template's intermittent reactive operating-factor formula uses the largest load, so export totals may differ from the website."
        ],
