      "role": "Pure workbook-equivalent formulas and dependent lists. CALC_COLS has 33 columns; INPUT_COLS has 39 (ITEM_COLS, the original 23, drive Item numbering). Numeric comparisons follow 15 significant digits. RowResult.helpers exposes the step05 helper columns (keys AT–AY, workbook BY–CD since step09) and helpers.fault (earthing system, nominal U0, transformer Z, Ze, Ia, IΔn, CPC type/k/multiplier/size/resistance, Ik, times, energies, final circuit). Earth fault loop for TN-S and TT with RCDs and CPC (AP–BG) and short circuit (BH–BO) via faultCells, chained from the feeding row (Ze ← Zs BB, TT only from a TT row; fault level ← BM); CHECK_COLS/failsCheck list every PASS/FAIL column (AG, AN, BE, BG, BJ, BO, BT). Motor starting VD (step09 BP–BT): BR = AL + (multiple − 1) × AK with the multiple typed (BQ) or the starter type's value on Lists (TABLES.starters), checked against BS or Settings Def_StartVD (15 %).",
