      "role": "Image pipeline shared by browser and tests: OCR of the page as drawn (PaddleOCR reads text among line work; erasing lines cut letters) in three orientations (upright, upward, downward text) with tiling for large sheets (each word kept from the tile that owns its centre), noise filter for short words, lone capitals kept only after an adjacent word of similar height, de-duplication of words read twice, then busbar/feeder tracing with text masked. The OCR engine is injected. Also tokenBox, traceLines (vector PDF pages) and scaleGeometry.",
